{"id":28074,"slug":"l-humanite","title":"L’humanité","year":1999,"country":"France","duration":148,"spine":981,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28074-l-humanite","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/cc2a4576d92b37879cacaf05ad117824/CU7xzGY5rwZS2wKOzGULe0JWSURUyN_large.jpg","description":"\nThe transcendent second feature by Bruno Dumont probes the wonder and horror of the human condition through the story of a profoundly alienated police detective (the indelibly sad-eyed Emmanuel Schotté, winner of an upset best actor prize at Cannes for his first film performance) who, while investigating the murder of a young girl, experiences jolting, epiphanous moments of emotional and physical connection. Demonstrating Dumont’s deftness with nonactors and relentlessly frank depiction of bodies and sexuality, L’humanité is at once an idiosyncratic police procedural and a provocative exploration of the tension between humankind’s capacity for compassion and our base, sometimes barbarous animal instincts.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Emmanuel Schotté","role":"Pharaon De Winter","slug":"emmanuel-schotte"},{"actor":"Séverine Caneele","role":"Domino","slug":"severine-caneele"},{"actor":"Philippe Tullier","role":"Joseph","slug":"philippe-tullier"},{"actor":"Ghislain Ghesquière","role":"Commandant","slug":"ghislain-ghesquiere"},{"actor":"Ginette Allègre","role":"Eliane","slug":"ginette-allegre"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Jean Bréhat","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Rachid Bouchareb","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Muriel Merlin","slug":null},{"role":"Photographed by","person":"Yves Cape","slug":null},{"role":"Sound by","person":"Pierre Mertens","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction by","person":"Ma